{"parentUuid":"c626d62d-fc77-4c18-86a0-a16cac784391","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"58dfe3bd-5765-4c89-8195-2459dbc080b5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"(2) is clearly what you're describing, and it's the right end-state. It's a substantial build (runtime discovery + dynamic matrix expansion + a list-typed param), so before I spend\n  on it I want to make sure I build the right shape: do you want me to go straight for (2) — the generic template where objects is a trigger param and fields auto-discover at run time\n  — or wire up (1) now as an interim while (2) lands? I'd default to building (2).\n\n\ngo with 2 and complete it"},"uuid":"9cdcff64-7d4b-42a5-9cfb-d9a16eab5d60","timestamp":"2026-09-01T00:55:11.967Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.231","gitBranch":"feat/native-byte-passthrough-633","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
