{"parentUuid":"5a5080cd-3227-47b2-95c5-81934195d514","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[{"id":"32","subject":"PR-prep sweep + docs for #633 (awaiting user go)","description":"Before opening PR #633: full workspace clippy (--workspace --all-targets, touch changed files first) + tests (faucet-core, faucet-source-rest, faucet-sink-bigquery) + patch coverage; docs — cookbook/reference for native byte-passthrough + JSON logging note; maintenance docs-sync surfaces; connectors.md/architecture.md notes. No commits/PR until user says done. Fork: user may want Arrow columnar (#635) first.","activeForm":"Prepping #633 PR sweep + docs","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"33","subject":"Clean concurrency re-sweep (6/8/10) after Meltano sync done — ON HOLD","description":"HOLD on all Salesforce/BQ runs to conserve credits/quota. The mc=8 wall-time varied 18.7↔22.1 min — attributed to a concurrent Meltano full sync contending for the shared lexipol org's Bulk API. Once Meltano's sync completes, re-run the concurrency sweep (6/8/10 at 50k) in the uncontended org to get a clean comparison. Memory result is robust regardless (~140-185MB flat). Do NOT trigger until user confirms Meltano is done.","activeForm":"Holding for clean concurrency re-sweep","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"34","subject":"#630: incremental replication for Salesforce Bulk / async_job","description":"Inject WHERE <replication_key> > <bookmark> into the submit SOQL (clause-aware); emit run-start timestamp as the new bookmark (native-compatible, no data parse); wire into both stream_pages_inner (Value path) and stream_native (#633). Reuse replication_method/replication_key/start_replication_value/runtime_start. Pure SOQL-injection helper + wiremock tests. Composes with write_mode upsert for a true mirror.","activeForm":"Implementing #630 incremental Salesforce Bulk","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"35","subject":"#639: lineage/catalog samplers preserve native fast path","description":"SamplingSource/SamplingSink forward native_output_formats/stream_native + native_load_capabilities/load_native with a tap that samples a bounded NDJSON prefix while passing bytes through unchanged. Add unit tests; rebuild catalog binary; re-run Salesforce catalog test to confirm native path selected (memory ~150MB) with datasets still recorded.","activeForm":"Fixing #639 native-path regression in samplers","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]}],"itemCount":4},"type":"attachment","uuid":"76644796-0c4b-4213-8dc9-cd175221373b","timestamp":"2026-09-01T01:12:46.774Z","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.231","gitBranch":"feat/native-byte-passthrough-633","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
