{"parentUuid":"b96ad33b-77a3-49b0-9336-9f46ef4c1119","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cebr7MvjkzbCT2irCoJWG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1224,"cache_read_input_tokens":898691,"output_tokens":1106,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":286},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1224,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1106,"cache_read_input_tokens":898691,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1224,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1224},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cebr6wQc1NnngXf8DDEve","type":"assistant","uuid":"fdb34ffa-477d-4b03-8fff-d88b5c102b98","timestamp":"2026-09-01T01:25:18.712Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.231","gitBranch":"feat/native-byte-passthrough-633","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
{"parentUuid":"fdb34ffa-477d-4b03-8fff-d88b5c102b98","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cebr7MvjkzbCT2irCoJWG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Option (2) is complete and live.** The generic template — where the object list is a trigger param and fields auto-discover at run time — works end-to-end, on both the CLI and the console.\n\n## What shipped (committed `e02ce51b`, pushed)\n\n- **`SalesforceDiscovery`** gained `fan_out: bool` (run-time fan-out), `sink_ref` (sink template per object), and `objects` now accepts a **comma-separated string** as well as a list — so it's drivable by one string param: `objects: \"${param.objects}\"` (`\"all\"` = every queryable object).\n- **`cli/src/dynamic_fanout.rs`** (new) — `resolve_dynamic_fanout` builds the `fan_out` source, runs `Source::discover()`, and generates the matrix (one row per object, field-complete SELECT + per-object sink) *at run time*. It's a runtime twin of `faucet discover`, wired **before `expand`** in both `faucet run` and `faucet serve`, mirroring the existing `resolve_config_bounds` pre-pass.\n- Regenerated `schemas/faucet.schema.json`; REST README documents both the generate-time and run-time flows.\n- Tests pass (fan-out + salesforce + schema), clippy clean.\n\n## Verified end-to-end\n\n- **CLI:** `faucet run salesforce_generic.yaml --param objects=\"Product2,RecordType,UserRole\"` → *\"generated matrix from live discovery, objects=3\"* → 3/3 synced, native fast-path, no pre-generated matrix.\n- **Console (the demo):** registered **one generic template** `salesforce-generic` (launched v1). Its **Trigger a run** form has an `objects` field (\"Comma-separated SObjects to sync, or 'all'\"); triggering it discovers + fans out live. The completed run shows the three objects that came *from the param* — Product2/RecordType/UserRole — with per-row timing and `template: salesforce-generic v1` provenance.\n\nSo the workflow you wanted is real: **register one generic Salesforce template, and at trigger just pass the object list — fields resolve live, new fields picked up automatically, no baked matrix.** For the whole 21-object set you'd trigger with `objects=\"all\"` (or the explicit list).\n\nOne note: the 18080 console is now running the freshly-built binary (serve features + the fan-out code), with `salesforce-generic` registered and launched, ready for you to trigger from the UI."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1224,"cache_read_input_tokens":898691,"output_tokens":1106,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":286},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1224,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1106,"cache_read_input_tokens":898691,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1224,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1224},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cebr6wQc1NnngXf8DDEve","type":"assistant","uuid":"f8b10c2d-a7f5-4c57-a44b-bd969ad948e0","timestamp":"2026-09-01T01:25:28.279Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.231","gitBranch":"feat/native-byte-passthrough-633","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
